alue": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le01ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Tell me about Peru.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  Peru is an awesome country. It's very inspiring. It has beautiful mountains and cute villages. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really! Where did you go?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le01ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: We sailed along the coast to the capital, Lima. We saw many remains of the ancient Inca civilization.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow, that's amazing!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: We also stopped at a coastal village and took a bus to Machu Picchu. The bus driver followed a special scenic route.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Did you meet anyone?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I made many new friends.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Did you meet anyone ... in particular?", "id": 2, "time": "10500", "image": "engenn5le01ob06re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Well, I did meet one girl.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Go on!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: She's a slender brunette with beautiful brown eyes.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Nice.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  She has long brown hair and a lovely smile.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm happy for you!", "id": 3, "time": "32500", "image": "engenn5le01ob06re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le01ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le01ob06re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "engenn5le01ob06re6aud02", "type": "audio"}], "_data": [], "type": "text", "template_override": 1}]}]}